      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "MV is where firepower goes automatic. Aluminum unlocks the SMGs, the assault rifles and a combat shotgun, plus grenades, the flashbang, three more armor sets and the akimbo pairs you can make from your LV sidearms. The guns, grenades and armor are MV Assembler recipes with aluminum in them; the akimbo pairs are crafted by hand.\n\nAmmunition changes too. SMGs and assault rifles take their own magazines, which are pressed in an MV Ammo Press, so build one (an MV press also runs every LV recipe, faster). The magazines need aluminum plates and springs.\n\nHold eight aluminum plates to open the chapter. The thick line runs through the parts, the SMG and the rifles; grenades, armor and the akimbo guns hang off to the side.\n\n[note]You can run LV recipes in an MV machine, so one MV press and one MV assembler cover everything so far.[/note]",
